      "quote": "To be included, the studies must use quantitative data and investigate the relationship between at least one independent variable (floor area, occupancy rate, number of rooms, carbon intensity, water use, among others) and the energy use in hotel buildings... The included studies have assessed the relationships among the variables using univariate or multivariate statistics techniques (i.e., correlations and/or regressions).",
