      "quote": "This review used meta-analysis on bivariate correlation coefficients, which are natural candidates to be an index of effect magnitude suitable for cumulation across studies [60]. As suggested in specialized literature [59-61] and applied in practice by Schmid and Morschett [55], the correlation coefficients between the variables were transformed using Fischer's Z scale. For presentation purposes, the values are then transformed back into correlation coefficients.",
